<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PJ America raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PJ America raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it upgraded PJ America Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- PJ America, a franchisee of Papa John's pizza restaurants, launched its initial public offering in October.</p>
</text>
